    "detailed_description": "<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779890/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1665064413\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779890/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1665064413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779890/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1665064413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Shoot your way through waves of enemies and extreme bosses in this Roguelite space shooter. Advance in the ranks, upgrade your ship and unlock new mechanics, ships and mods that will make the game more challanging and interesting.</strong><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Upgrade your ship.<br></li><li>6 different difficulty levels.<br></li><li>5 ships to unlock.<br></li><li>Advance in the rank, upgrade your abilities and unlocked new staff.<br></li><li>Buy drones and runes.<br></li><li>5 types of weapons that each has dozens of upgrades.<br></li><li>A lot of mods to unlock that will make the game more challanging.</li></ul></strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1779890/extras/f58f6835799e05beb055ba6940aafc5a.avif?t=1665064413\" /></div>",
